The Prometheus instance ID.', example='rw-bbe8961b4a59be0'),
  namespace?: string(name='namespace', description='Applicable data source type: ENTERPRISE_DS.

The name of the Hybrid Cloud Monitoring metric repository.', example='aliyun-default'),
  regionId?: string(name='regionId', description='Applicable data source types: APM_DS and PROMETHEUS_DS.

The region ID of the data source.', example='cn-hangzhou'),
  tenantId?: string(name='tenantId', description='Applicable data source type: ENTERPRISE_DS.

The tenant ID of the Hybrid Cloud Monitoring data source. Identifies the tenant in the Hybrid Cloud Monitoring environment.', example='1234567890'),
  type: string(name='type', description='The data source type.

Valid values:
- PROMETHEUS_DS: Prometheus data source.
- SLS_MULTI_DS: SLS data source.
- APM_DS: Application monitoring data source.
- CMS_BASIC_DS: CloudMonitor Basic data source.
- ENTERPRISE_DS: Hybrid Cloud Monitoring data source.

This parameter is required.', example='PROMETHEUS_DS'),
