    Joinings
  ](name='joinings', description='The join list (used when type=SLS_MULTI_QUERY. Maximum of 2: joinings[0] corresponds to the set operation between query 0 and query 1. joinings[1] corresponds to the set operation between query 1 and query 2).'),
